 "remarks": "Welcome to 50 Aiken Street #262, a 2-bedroom, 1-bath end unit in the sought-after Rolling Ridge Condo Association. This spacious residence offers a functional layout with comfortable living and dining areas, in-unit laundry, and a private patio for enjoying the outdoors. Heat and hot water are included, adding to the convenience of condo living. Rolling Ridge offers a variety of amenities, including a community pool, tennis court, and picturesque pond with a fountain, along with ample parking and a pet-friendly environment. Conveniently located with easy access to I-95, the Route 7 Connector, and the Merritt Parkway, this home offers easy access to all that Norwalk and the surrounding area have to offer.",
